WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:19.847
Rabbit: Watch me run.

2
00:00:19.848 --> 00:00:23.556
Frog: Can you run around the rock?

3
00:00:23.557 --> 00:00:27.103
Rabbit: I can run around the rock.

4
00:00:27.104 --> 00:00:47.446
Rabbit: Watch me run around the rock.

5
00:00:47.447 --> 00:00:51.268
Frog: Can you run up the hill?

6
00:00:51.269 --> 00:00:55.070
Rabbit: I can run up the hill.

7
00:00:55.071 --> 00:01:16.122
Rabbit: Watch me run up the hill.

8
00:01:16.123 --> 00:01:23.944
Frog: Can you run across the log?

9
00:01:23.945 --> 00:01:26.999
Rabbit: I can run across the log.

10
00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:38.106
Rabbit: Watch me run across the log.

11
00:01:38.107 --> 00:01:42.192
Fish: Whoa!

12
00:01:42.193 --> 00:01:45.340
Frog: Can you swim?

13
00:01:45.341 --> 00:01:58.593
Rabbit: Yes, I can swim.

